WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,950
start

2
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,100
I thought you were a master of Tibetan blessings after all.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,100
Why should the ruling and opposition parties use more force to avoid losing too badly?

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,380
As a result, you are completely helpless.

5
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:17,800
Quickly pass military doctor General Zhang

6
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:21,000
I told you not to compete, so why bother, Your Highness?

7
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,160
You didn't say he was so strong.

8
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,840
With one move, I was cut into pieces.

9
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:30,050
Your Highness is not well

10
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,770
Another monk from Qi State came to the city.

11
00:00:31,770 --> 00:00:35,010
Possessing the two magical powers of Jin Zhongzhao and Powerful Diamond Paper, attack and defense are integrated

12
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:37,490
He is already the company commander of our army’s private support general. What are you looking at?

13
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,450
I am a counselor, not a general

14
00:00:39,650 --> 00:00:41,050
Never go out and fight with others

15
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,250
Damn thing

16
00:00:42,250 --> 00:00:45,170
If my arm had not been injured, I would have killed this thief, Mr. Li.

17
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,930
You can bear this if I were you

18
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:50,490
Go out early to avenge your dead brothers. General Zhang’s family said

19
00:00:50,490 --> 00:00:51,650
Someone is a counselor

20
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,210
Why do you always send a counselor into battle?

21
00:00:53,210 --> 00:00:54,330
What does this sound like?

22
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,660
This is how your remnant army gains glory.

23
00:00:56,660 --> 00:00:59,020
Let the Black Sand God General come out and die.

24
00:00:59,020 --> 00:01:00,740
The thieves and donkeys who repair medicine are as rampant as Mr. Li comes

25
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:02,700
I will tear your head off, sir.

26
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:05,180
He's obviously a big boss and still pretends to be a scholar. Damn it.

27
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,540
Let the black sand god die
